    {
      "text": "yield to the persuasions of men no more, D&C 5:21. These words are not of men, D&C 18:34. love of men shall wax cold, D&C 45:27. turn their hearts from me because of the precepts of men, D&C 45:29. men should be anxiously engaged in a good cause, D&C 58:27. signs come by faith, not by the will of men, D&C 63:10. of you it is required to forgive all men, D&C 64:10. just men made perfect through Jesus, D&C 76:69 (129:3). These are they who are honorable men, D&C 76:75. third trump … then come the spirits of men who are to be judged, D&C 88:100. reveal the secret acts of men, D&C 88:108. evils … exist in the hearts of conspiring men, D&C 89:4. in him was the life of men and the light of men, D&C 93:9. honest men and wise men should be sought for diligently, D&C 98:10. hearts … aspire to the honors of men, D&C 121:35. blinded by the subtle craftiness of men, D&C 123:12. he holds men accountable for their acts, D&C 134:1.",
